{
  "slug": "standup-logger",
  "name": "Standup Logger",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automatic daily standup logger for Claude Code. Logs session work with Jira ticket IDs (if found) to per-date files and generates ready-to-speak standup summaries.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Commands** (2): `standup-log` (Log current session work to the daily standup file), `standup` (Generate daily standup content from your work log)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install standup-logger@claude-community` from `mohitgoel188/standup-logger`.",
